{
  "_note": "CRM field schema for autonomous provisioning (functions/zoho/provision-crm.mjs). Picklist values with 'values_from' resolve from config/tenant-richenquest.json (single source of truth); inline 'values' are CRM-specific. 'manual:true' = API can't reliably create it -> left for console. Module rename Deals->Student Cases is console-only; Student-Case fields are created on the 'Deals' module. Field API names auto-derive from label in Zoho. ACCOUNTS/PRODUCTS fields back the Collaboration CRM and University Partnership OS; the Deals 'Career Record Id' links a Student Case to its Career Record subject. Every field here is written by functions/ops -- a field missing from this file is a write that fails in production.",
  "modules": {
    "Leads": [
      {
        "label": "Lead Type",
        "type": "picklist",
        "values_from": "lead_types"
      },
      {
        "label": "Market",
        "type": "picklist",
        "values_from": "markets"
      },
      {
        "label": "Lead Source Detail",
        "type": "picklist",
        "values": [
          "Website Form",
          "WhatsApp",
          "Instagram",
          "Facebook",
          "LinkedIn",
          "YouTube",
          "TikTok",
          "Google Ads",
          "Walk-in",
          "Referral",
          "Education Fair",
          "Other"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Interested Country",
        "type": "multiselectpicklist",
        "values_from": "destinations"
      },
      {
        "label": "Interested Level",
        "type": "picklist",
        "values": [
          "Bachelor's",
          "Master's",
          "Diploma",
          "PhD",
          "PR/Immigration",
          "Other"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Intended Intake",
